OL,3,GNEWSACourt reopens after crack in wall
OL,4,Aforced closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham Crown Court has reopened
OL,7,Fafter a crack in a wall forced a
OL,8,Ftemporary closure.
OL,10,FThe building on Canal Street was
OL,11,Fevacuated on Wednesday after damage was
OL,12,Ffound at the entrance, and some cases
OL,13,Fwere moved to Nottingham Magistrates'
OL,14,FCourt.
OL,16,FLast year, a leading barrister warned
OL,17,Fthere had been issues with the
OL,18,Fbuilding, including leaks in several
OL,19,Fcourtrooms and broken heating, and some
OL,20,Fusers have since called for the court
OL,21,Fto be knocked down and replaced.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
