OL,3,GNEWSACourt reopens after crack in wall
OL,4,Aforced closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Justice (MoJ)
OL,7,Fspokesperson confirmed on Monday that
OL,8,Fthe court had fully reopened.
